{"id":4202,"date":"2011-10-17T10:35:35","date_gmt":"2011-10-17T06:35:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?p=4202"},"modified":"2020-02-09T09:48:30","modified_gmt":"2020-02-09T05:48:30","slug":"wom-india-installs-manifold-on-aban-rig","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wom-india-installs-manifold-on-aban-rig\/","title":{"rendered":"WOM India Installs Manifold on Aban Rig"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em><strong>Story by Kabir Lulla<br> Bus. Dev. Manager<br> Access Oilfield Solutions<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cFrom my personal experience prior to joining the oilfield industry, I had absolutely no idea of the magnitude of operation coupled with technology that was involved in getting that gallon of gas each time I drove up to fill up my car.<br> \u201cI have been fortunate to have visited several rigs, but interestingly, each time the experience is overwhelming and I return with a new found<br> respect for all the people out there that make this happen. And we can proudly say that as part of the WOM family, we too are part of this fascinating industry.\u201d &#8211; <strong>Kabir Lulla, Access Oil<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On September 18, 2011, as part of a field trip, a team of 12 WOM associates visited an Aban offshore jack up rig (top picture) being refurbished at the Western India Shipyard in Goa. This rig is being upgraded to a 15K system and as part of this upgrade, WOM have supplied a 3 1\/16\u201d 15K Model 200M Choke &amp; Kill Manifold (enlarged pictured, bottom left) along with a choke control console and an oilfield skid. The drive to Goa itself was eventful with what should normally be a 7 hour journey turning into a 17 hour journey, with car trouble along the way. However, the excitement of the opportunity of visiting a Jack Up rig for the first time kept the spirits high (both literally and figuratively!) <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/WOM-India-choke-kill-manifold.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"4204\" class=\"wp-image-4204 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\" src=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/WOM-India-choke-kill-manifold.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"4204\" class=\"wp-image-4204\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/WOM-India-choke-kill-manifold.jpg 500w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/WOM-India-choke-kill-manifold-300x225.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/noscript><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">WOM India\u2019s choke &amp; kill manifold<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"311\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/TheTeam.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"4205\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/?attachment_id=4205\" class=\"wp-image-4205 lazyload\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"311\" src=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/TheTeam.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"4205\" data-link=\"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/?attachment_id=4205\" class=\"wp-image-4205\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/TheTeam.jpg 500w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/08\/TheTeam-300x187.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/noscri